From bd856fc9e139e2ea9c66f61cadab41f3d32c8b36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fizban <35464167+Fiztba@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:49:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Decouple KFIV fixed updates from interpolated presentation

Guard the original frame limiter by game identity and instruction signatures. Yield its original continuation on rational NTSC deadlines while hardware time and callbacks continue. Render conservatively matched geometry on isolated GS copies without feeding presentation into guest memory. Keep queues bounded and verify unmodified endpoints before interpolation. Enable through explicit launch settings.
